reast Cancer Awareness Month</title><link href="https://siliconsaga.github.io/upac-site/news/2026/breast-cancer-awareness-fundraiser/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="October is Breast Cancer Awareness Month" /><published>2026-10-01T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-10-01T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://siliconsaga.github.io/upac-site/news/2026/breast-cancer-awareness-fundraiser</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://siliconsaga.github.io/upac-site/news/2026/breast-cancer-awareness-fundraiser/"><![CDATA[<p>October is Breast Cancer Awareness Month, and UPAC is raising money for <a href="https://www.aangelsnj.org/">AAngelsNJ</a>.</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Join UPAC in raising money for AAngelsNJ.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://siliconsaga.github.io/upac-site/assets/news/breast-cancer-awareness-fundraiser/breast-cancer-fundraiser.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://siliconsaga.github.io/upac-site/assets/news/breast-cancer-awareness-fundraiser/breast-cancer-fundraiser.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Welcome to our dance class</title><link href="https://siliconsaga.github.io/upac-site/news/2026/welcome-to-our-dance-class/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Welcome to our dance class" /><published>2026-09-15T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-09-15T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://siliconsaga.github.io/upac-site/news/2026/welcome-to-our-dance-class</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://siliconsaga.github.io/upac-site/news/2026/welcome-to-our-dance-class/"><![CDATA[<p>Five of our youngest dancers on their first day, in front of the chalkboard. Welcome to our dance class!</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[First-day smiles from five of our youngest dancers.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mr